-- src:746 | như sau:
-- The table of minimum remaining-quality rates, by time in use (1.15, in months; fork F10).
-- "đến 01 năm" is up to and including 12 months; "từ trên 01 năm đến hết 03 năm" is over 12
-- and up to and including 36; and so on.
-- src:747 | o Thời gian đã sử dụng đến 01 năm: 100%
-- src:748 | o Thời gian đã sử dụng từ trên 01 năm đến hết 03 năm: 85% o
-- src:749 | Thời gian đã sử dụng từ trên 03 năm đến hết 06 năm: 70% o
-- src:750 | Thời gian đã sử dụng từ trên 06 năm đến hết 10 năm: 55% o
-- src:751 | Thời gian đã sử dụng trên 10 năm: 40%
@ref O-Car rules, Article 13.2 table (src:747-751)
GIVEN `the time in use, in months` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`13.2 — the minimum remaining-quality rate for a time in use, in months, of` `the time in use, in months` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the time in use, in months` AT MOST  12 THEN 100%
           IF `the time in use, in months` AT MOST  36 THEN  85%
           IF `the time in use, in months` AT MOST  72 THEN  70%
           IF `the time in use, in months` AT MOST 120 THEN  55%
           OTHERWISE                                       40%

-- Fork F22: the table applies to (i), a used vehicle made in Vietnam; (ii), a vehicle imported
-- after use abroad, takes the rate "xác định trong tờ khai hải quan nhập khẩu" (stated in the
-- import customs declaration). Fork F23: "nhập khẩu đã qua sử dụng" in (ii) is read as 1.15
-- reads it, imported after use abroad. A vehicle imported new and now used, or a new vehicle,
-- whose market value cannot be determined, is in neither limb (finding X10): declined.
@ref O-Car rules, Article 13.2(ii) (src:742-744)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`13.2(ii) takes the rate from the import customs declaration, and none is recorded` MEANS
    REFUSE "13.2(ii) takes the rate from the import customs declaration, and none is recorded"

@ref O-Car rules, Article 13.2 (src:736-744)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`13.2 gives no value for a new vehicle, or one imported new, whose market value cannot be determined` MEANS
    REFUSE "13.2 gives no value for a new vehicle, or one imported new, whose market value cannot be determined"

@ref O-Car rules, Article 13.2(i)-(ii) (src:739-744)
GIVEN p IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`13.2 — the value of the vehicle when insured, by formula, on` p MEANS
    IF   p's `vehicle`'s `new (100%) when insured`
    THEN `13.2 gives no value for a new vehicle, or one imported new, whose market value cannot be determined`
    ELSE CONSIDER p's `vehicle`'s `origin`
         WHEN `manufactured in Vietnam` THEN
             p's `price of the vehicle new (100%)`
             TIMES `13.2 — the minimum remaining-quality rate for a time in use, in months, of` (`1.15 — the time in use of the vehicle, in months` p)
         WHEN `imported after use abroad` THEN
             CONSIDER p's `minimum remaining-quality rate in the import customs declaration`
             WHEN JUST r  THEN p's `price of the vehicle new (100%)` TIMES r
             WHEN NOTHING THEN `13.2(ii) takes the rate from the import customs declaration, and none is recorded`
         WHEN `imported new` THEN
             `13.2 gives no value for a new vehicle, or one imported new, whose market value cannot be determined`

-- The value the settlement rests on: the market value when the parties determined it (13.1),
-- else the 13.2 formula.
@ref O-Car rules, Articles 13.1 and 13.2 (src:726-751)
GIVEN p IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`13 — the value of the vehicle when insured, on` p MEANS
    CONSIDER p's `market value when insured`
    WHEN JUST v  THEN v
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `13.2 — the value of the vehicle when insured, by formula, on` p

§§ `13.2 last bullet — the declared value, and under- and over-insurance`

-- src:752 | - Giá trị khai báo là giá trị Xe Ô Tô mà Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm kê khai khi yêu cầu
-- src:753 | bảo hiểm và được ghi trên Hợp Đồng Bảo Hiểm/Giấy Chứng Nhận Bảo Hiểm.
-- src:754 | Trường hợp giá trị khai báo thấp hơn (bảo hiểm dưới giá trị) hoặc cao hơn Giá
-- src:755 | Thị Trường (bảo hiểm trên giá trị) thì Giá Thị Trường sẽ là cơ sở để Công Ty Bảo
-- src:756 | Hiểm giải quyết bồi thường.
@ref O-Car rules, Article 13.2 last bullet (src:752-756)
GIVEN p IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`13 — insured below value, on` p MEANS
    p's `sum insured` LESS THAN `13 — the value of the vehicle when insured, on` p

@ref O-Car rules, Article 13.2 last bullet (src:752-756); Article 1.10 (src:96-98)
GIVEN p IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`13 — insured above value, on` p MEANS
    NOT `1.10 — the sum insured is not greater than the market value when insured` (p's `sum insured`) (`13 — the value of the vehicle when insured, on` p)
